  "answer_text": "- The busiest traffic windows at the main gates were at 09:00 with 1,620,671 people, 14:00 with 1,438,248 people, and 16:00 with 1,366,053 people.\n- Keynote hall attendance peaked at 09:00 with 1,620,671 attendees, 14:00 with 1,438,248 attendees, and 16:00 with 1,366,053 attendees.\n- Lunchtime dynamics at the food court showed peaks at 12:00 with 432,169 people and 13:00 with 431,878 people.\n- The NVIDIA demo booth experienced higher crowd activity compared to Intel, with peaks at 15:00 (251,999 people) and 16:00 (252,407 people), while Intel's peaks were at 15:00 (151,005 people) and 16:00 (150,959 people).\n- Overall, the NVIDIA booth consistently attracted more visitors than the Intel booth throughout the day.",
